description:
### Eiyuu Senki GOLD - WWX Edition v1.5.0.3 Final (21.05.2022)

 Welcome to the world of ES, again. We present to you ES GOLD WWX Edition - a fan-made port for content from a mobile gacha game Eiyuu Senki - World Wonder X.
The purpose of this port is to transfer all “visual novel” parts of WWX to the ES GOLD engine, excluding any gameplay-related content.
IMPORTANT: THIS PORT DOESN’T INCLUDE ANY NEW PLAYABLE CHARACTERS OR BATTLES, IT WAS ALWAYS INTENDED FOR READING ONLY.

 This port include:
 - 272 character event chains, including voice-acted H-scenes;
 - 78+ common events and 28 Arena events;
 - WWX main campaign (including True Route campaign).
 All content is up to date with Japanese WWX v.1.6.5 (29.03.2022).

Additional content in the Optional folder:
- WWX loading screens (for viewing only, doesn’t need an installation);
- WWX purge (destroyed clothes) images for all playable characters (for viewing only, doesn’t need an installation);
Free Mode unlock (see p.V for detailed explanation);
Full Japanese scripts (restore scripts with English localization to their original Japanese counterparts);
DOESN’T change character and event names back to Japanese);
Game opening with original WWX theme (replace our Easter egg music in the OP with original WWX theme).

This port does NOT include:
- new playable characters;
- new battles;
- 2D animated sprites from original WWX;
- WWX character’s voice lines for poking function in Units menu.
Additional info is available in the Readme.

Changelog:
 1.5.0.1 hotfix - added 28th Arena (Final Event).
 1.5.0.2 hotfix - fixed crash in Sakanoue Tamuramaro event.
 1.5.0.3 update:
 - Fixed crash in Unkei and Kaikei event;
 - Added English translation to few untranslated parts of common events 5 and 16 (translated by Winkel-hime*);
 - Cleaned up UI in Gallery.

Important: 
Eiyuu Senki WWX ended service on 29th March 2022. 
1.5.0.3 should be the final version of this mod.
